Package: Rang
Type: Package
Title: Color Palettes from Persian Art
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Mohsen", "Tahmasebi Nasab",
    email = "mohsen.tahmasebi.n@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Color palettes drawn from Persian art and documented source
    photographs. Includes discrete and continuous palettes for plots and maps,
    with ggplot2 scales for categorical and numeric variables.
